"1. Open D65 Probe on your iPhone and keep it on the same Wi-Fi as this Mac." = "1. 在 iPhone 上打开 D65 Probe，并和这台 Mac 连接同一个 Wi-Fi。";
"2. Turn off True Tone and Night Shift for now, and keep the room light steady and not too bright." = "2. 暂时关闭「原彩显示」和「夜览」，房间光线保持稳定，不要太亮。";
"3. Leave the monitor at the brightness and contrast you normally use — changing contrast later makes a calibration stale." = "3. 显示器保持你平时用的亮度和对比度 — 之后再改对比度会让校准失效。";
