"2. Turn off True Tone and Night Shift for now. The MacBook screen lights up for the measurement and goes back to its brightness afterwards." = "2. 暂时关闭「原彩显示」和「夜览」。测量时 MacBook 屏会临时点亮，测完恢复原来的亮度。";
"4. Let the monitor warm up for 20–30 minutes first, and turn off its own dynamic contrast, eco mode and auto-brightness." = "4. 显示器先开机预热 20～30 分钟，并关掉它自己的动态对比度、节能模式和自动亮度。";
